  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The ADDVISOR by SmartAdditions!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">A unique auto accessory that adds a second car visor, completely independent of the standard car visor, to virtually any vehicle.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The independent installation lets drivers (and passengers) use The ADDVISOR to block sun glare in the front and, at the same time, block glare from the side with the car's standard visor.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">This creates Two-Direction Sun <span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Protection&trade;</span> so drivers can focus on the road for safety and enjoy a comfortable ride without the distraction caused by moving the car visor back and forth when the road turns and the sun's angle changes, bringing glare from the other direction.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">This feature is currently only available in high-end Mercedes, BMW, Porsche, and a couple of other expensive automobiles.<br>With The ADDVISOR SmartAdditions wants to bring this luxury benefit to virtually any vehicle.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Join our affiliate program and share this luxury solution with your community!</p>",
